  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t12_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": -560,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Layouts on a circle\n\n`RingSpread` lays N points around a circle. Its `positions` output gives them directly — but here we use the `angles` output and build the layout by hand: inside a ForEach, take cos/sin of each angle, multiply by a radius, and draw a shape.\n\nResult: 24 dots evenly placed on a ring.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Layouts on a circle\n\n`RingSpread` lays N points around a circle. Its `positions` output gives them directly — but here we use the `angles` output and build the layout by hand: inside a ForEach, take cos/sin of each angle, multiply by a radius, and draw a shape.\n\nResult: 24 dots evenly placed on a ring.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
